r="0" cellspacing="1" cellpadding="3"><tr><td bgcolor="000000" background="themes/0ri0n/images/cellpic1.gif"><font class="topictitle">Main Menu</font></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="222222"><font class="content"><font class="content"><strong><big>&middot;</big></strong>&nbsp;<a class="pn-normal" href="index.php" title="Back to the home page.">Home</a><br /><strong><big>&middot;</big></strong>&nbsp;<a class="pn-normal" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=Calzone&amp;file=index" title="Calendar of events.">Calendar</a><br /><strong><big>&middot;</big></strong>&nbsp;<a class="pn-normal" href="index.php?module=htmlpages&pid=2" title="Our Charter.">Charter</a><br /><strong><big>&middot;</big></strong>&nbsp;<a class="pn-normal" href="index.php?module=htmlpages&pid=3" title="How to contact us.">Contacts</a><br /><strong><big>&middot;</big></strong>&nbsp;<a class="pn-normal" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=phpBB2&amp;file=index" title="Message Boards">Forums</a><br /><strong><big>&middot;</big></strong>&nbsp;<a class="pn-normal" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=gallery&amp;file=index" title="Photos/Screenshots/Maps">Gallery</a><br /><strong><big>&middot;</big></strong>&nbsp;<a class="pn-normal" href="index.php?module=htmlpages&pid=1" title="How to join.">Joining</a><br /><strong><big>&middot;</big></strong>&nbsp;<a class="pn-normal" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=news&amp;file=index" title="Latest News on the guild.">News</a><br /><strong><big>&middot;</big></strong>&nbsp;<a class="pn-normal" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=search&amp;file=index" title="Search our website.">Search</a><br /><strong><big>&middot;</big></strong>&nbsp;<a class="pn-normal" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=web_links&amp;file=index" title="Links to other sites.">Web Links</a><br /><br /><b>All things EverQuest</b><br /><strong><big>&middot;</big></strong>&nbsp;<a class="pn-normal" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=doze&amp;file=index" title="Doze Tear Chart">Doze Tear Chart</a><br /><strong><big>&middot;</big></strong>&nbsp;<a class="pn-normal" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=Roster&amp;file=index" title="Listing of Members Everquest Characters">Guild Roster</a><br /><strong><big>&middot;</big></strong>&nbsp;<a class="pn-normal" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=Velious_Gem_Chart&amp;file=index" title="Velious Gems for Quest Armor">Velious Gem Chart</a><br /><br /></font></font></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><br><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="150" bgcolor="8c1818"><tr><td><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="1" cellpadding="3"><tr><td bgcolor="000000" background="themes/0ri0n/images/cellpic1.gif"><font class="topictitle">Last 10 Visitors</font></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="222222"><font class="content"><font class="content"><center><b>Anonymous</b><br>02/03/2003 8:36:05 am</center><br><center><b>Anonymous</b><br>02/03/2003 8:35:25 am</center><br><center><a href="user.php?op=userinfo&uname=Gracell"><b>Gracell</b></a><br>02/03/2003 8:35:16 am</center><br><center><b>Anonymous</b><br>02/03/2003 8:32:06 am</center><br><center><b>Anonymous</b><br>02/03/2003 8:27:45 am</center><br><center><a href="user.php?op=userinfo&uname=Weynu"><b>Weynu</b></a><br>02/03/2003 8:26:35 am</center><br><center><b>Anonymous</b><br>02/03/2003 8:25:11 am</center><br><center><b>Anonymous</b><br>02/03/2003 8:24:23 am</center><br><center><b>Anonymous</b><br>02/03/2003 8:17:08 am</center><br><center><a href="user.php?op=userinfo&uname=Ugak"><b>Ugak</b></a><br>02/03/2003 8:17:02 am</center><br></font></font></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><br><img src="images/pix.gif" border="0" width="150" height="1"></td><td>&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td width="100%" valign="top"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" bgcolor="000000" width="100%"><tr><td><table border="0" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="1" width="100%"><tr><td bgcolor="000000" background="themes/0ri0n/images/cellpic1.gif"><b><a class="pn-title" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=news&amp;file=article&amp;sid=49&amp;mode=thread&amp;order=0&amp;thold=0">Wee</a></b><br></font></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="000000"><font class="tiny">Posted by <b>Tiberinus Maximus</b> on Tuesday, January 28, 2003 - 08:25 PM PST (30 Reads)<br><br>Gee thanks Pravus Bratus for letting us attempt Vindicator as if we never did it - you are so gracious what would we ever do without your patience?   Just like when you let us have Klandicar when you had all of 2 people in the zone and we were about to engage.   Damn, I tell you - the pressure is intense here.   Just remember what is said in  guild chat about silly plans like lag em out, train em, leap over em always leaks out because there are people who just dont like that shit.   Got some really good people in there though - the competition is fun.<br />
<br />
Anyway - we kill stuff for the fun of it not in hopes of getting some uber phat lewts - like when tonight I get killed by this fucking trash heap in PoI while screwing around with a group of friends exping a little.  <br />
<br />
So I call in the pimps and hookers to do some ass raping of it - before you know it - we got 30 people, 15 mobs all around us (4 people run up groupless and buffless with a few of em hehe)  and 30 seconds later a dead Junk Beast - never fought this bitch before was fun.   Loot the motivator?  Hell no, it was revenge - I dont think we even used the loot - but god damn we bitch slapped that rust bucket.   <br />
<br />
See, I remember when PoP first comes out.   The fear of zoning into PoI and dying from the trains.   This time I say its enough, zone in and kill everything.   There wasnt a mob standing left or right, tin solders, everything.   Then we see Junk Beast at the end of the left trail - and we all know there are quite a few mobs there - well, they all come - and they all died - at once.    Had we gone in there with just enough to kill Junkie would have taken forever, and everyone got to smile at the revenge of owning the mobs that trained everyone - I beleive we had the guild in there and cleared left before my corpse even showed up at the GY.   Kick ass work guys.<br />
<br />
When are people going to realize the difference between overwhelming force and throwing bodies at a mob in hopes it dies before you all do is not the same thing.   One is just plain fun the other is zerging.    Both give you a rush.   Both give the same result.   Its not zerging when you pull the entire library, King and all the mobs in between at once, thats kicking ass on old content.   Zerging is when you use 70 people to kill CT and your strategy is to bind rush him (Yes, I watched this first hand and mourned the poor god for being gimped). <br />
<br />
Like that bitch on the dock in OOT.  You remember her?   She killed you on the boat.   Do you cry?  No, you FUCKING WRITE THAT SHIT DOWN ON YOUR LIST.   Then you go get her back.   Tie the corpse to a tree and well - the rest is censored.<br />
<br />
Yeah, good old revenge.<br><br>
<br><br></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="000000" align="left"><font class="content">3 Comments <a class="pn-normal" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=recommend_us&amp;file=index&amp;req=FriendSend&amp;sid=49"><img src="images/global/friend.gif" border="0" alt="Send this story to a friend"></a> <a class="pn-normal" href="print.php?sid=49"><img src="images/global/print.gif" border="0" alt="Printer friendly page"></a></font></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><br><br><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" bgcolor="000000" width="100%"><tr><td><table border="0" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="1" width="100%"><tr><td bgcolor="000000" background="themes/0ri0n/images/cellpic1.gif"><b><a class="pn-title" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=news&amp;file=article&amp;sid=48&amp;mode=thread&amp;order=0&amp;thold=0">Last epic run</a></b><br></font></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="000000"><font class="tiny">Posted by <b>Tiberinus Maximus</b> on Thursday, January 23, 2003 - 01:14 PM PST (8 Reads)<br><br>Being tired of dealing with Kunark era stuff we did a mad push for epics last week by doing a few Chardok pushes.   Now let me tell you, when you pull ALL of the mobs from Kings room (including King) and all of the mobs in the hall way and the two rooms before the library and litterally kick his ass its fun.    Its fun to kill queenie - she is still a bitch with that AE of hers, but fun still.<br />
<br />
All I know is, everyone hates Chardok, and doing it three days in a row for two hours just pisses everyone off.  Then people start getting achy and bitchy.   <br />
<br />
Then Fear has everything up except CT - Rares galore.   Mass Buff, wait for the enchanter to get there and then reboot for like what an Hour feeling like sheepish noobs then saying fuck it - zone in and run west an pretty much kill 25% of the zone at once made up for all the old school north wall CoH break in bull shit we did and was quite fun.   Killed everything, two robes dropped - thanks for 2% exp.   Lots of BPs dropped.   WTF is it with BPs.  Broken Golem and Dread pulled and owned along with a few other mobs - fun fun - some boxes dropped.   Shissar then spawned (After the previous night watching her die to the inhabitants of fear - fucking retarded asses fix the Broken Golem but they break Shissar).   So we send in our fearless pally to pull everything, temple and all, and well - he does - brings us shissar and quite a few Amys - all of them I think.   Then we realize another guild was after fear - talk about sucking to realize they could have used the shit we didnt need.  Sucks big time.<br />
<br />
I beleive we got 5 Cleric epics, 4 Warriors closer, an enchanter epic (almost two thanks VI for bugging a zone), a wizard epic, 2 shaman epics and even though its a secret a ranger epic.   Oops hehe.<br />
<br />
Anyway, maybe once a month we might do epic work for people - but its super low on our priorities.  So is HoT - tired of factioning - going to start doing North and kissing CoV Ally good bye.   Sure Vindi, Statue and KT will help keep us non KoS to an extent but its pretty much over when you have bags of MQ items you cant give away to alts.<br />
<br />
Oh yeah, KLANDICAR - Let me tell you about that fucking bastard.<br />
<br />
Remember a few stories down we lost him due to server going to down?   Well, this time we find him up, someone in PM said oh we dont need the key you can have even though we were about the engage and they had like 1 person in the zone - yeah right whatever suck my ass thanks.<br />
<br />
So, we start keeling him and the zone crashes, at 3%.   Dont you just hate that?   Well, at least we still had junks when we came back but OH MY GOD there were like 500 wolves in the zone and never have I seen such chaos moving 200 feet.    We killed Telk with people not in a group, buffless and of course his easy death was matched by his shitty loot - I think his loot rotted cause nobody wanted it.   Pissed me off to no end that we missed getting another ST key due to VI - that two you fuckers owe us thanks.<br />
<br />
Oh well, was fun although we all want to kill each other - I think its time for the naked gnome race to SSra.<br><br>
<br><br></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="000000" align="left"><font class="content">comments? <a class="pn-normal" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=recommend_us&amp;file=index&amp;req=FriendSend&amp;sid=48"><img src="images/global/friend.gif" border="0" alt="Send this story to a friend"></a> <a class="pn-normal" href="print.php?sid=48"><img src="images/global/print.gif" border="0" alt="Printer friendly page"></a></font></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><br><br><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" bgcolor="000000" width="100%"><tr><td><table border="0" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="1" width="100%"><tr><td bgcolor="000000" background="themes/0ri0n/images/cellpic1.gif"><b><a class="pn-title" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=news&amp;file=article&amp;sid=47&amp;mode=thread&amp;order=0&amp;thold=0">More fun doing what we could find.</a></b><br></font></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="000000"><font class="tiny">Posted by <b>Tiberinus Maximus</b> on Sunday, January 12, 2003 - 10:50 AM PST (17 Reads)<br><br>Ok first of all.<br />
<br />
FUCK YOU ZONE CRASHES.<br />
<br />
Nothing worse than moving to ToV to kill a rare and the zone crash - well, perhaps the guild in North wasnt too damn happy either, hehe.<br />
<br />
FUCK YOU PATCHES.<br />
<br />
After calling off ToV, Kland pops.  Ok, we move in, set up and start to junk it up and a ten minute warning to patch comes out - Fucking assholes.   Hey, lets pull a Ghost Busters - GET HIM.   Half the guild goes LD, ten people die as a result then the game boots us all.   Oh well, was fun.<br />
<br />
Two rares fucked away and it was nobody but Sony's fault.   /rude<br />
<br />
At least we got another Rhag run, some nice arms some more spells to hold us over.<br />
<br />
Ok, so Friday we going to kill shit in Chardok - damn guild is moving there as well and planned for it and posted on that ignored reservation board - ok well we can do it next day and bow out even though we were FiF didnt want to deal with people bickering - ok another guild is there next day doing it all day.   <br />
<br />
What the fuck is up with all day camps on King - do you have to move down there and live for a whole day?   Royals should be a 3 hour raid for 2 rounds TOPS (and only because of the 2 hour respawn), not 8 hours for two or three.   That shit is getting on my nerves - I guess we'll just move down next time some calls it camped and sit there breathing down thier necks for a while.   Oh well, Royals are a necessity to get clerics happy.<br />
<br />
Ok, so we kill Telk with like 20 people (revenge for the crash I say) - showed that guild  watching you dont need 45 people to kill a monster - I know they were waiting on failure - it was clear as daylight, just dont panic like all the fucking retards training Zone Out in the planes and you can win.   Im sure someone better than us could kill with like 6 but then they wouldnt like the shit that dropped so it would be like me AEing the entire GuK zone - for the hell of it.<br />
<br />
Grats Deth on eyepatch and Wincer on the Head thing - Kurgin on the new beat stick.<br />
<br />
Then we go kill Velketor for the hell of it - grats some Mage we saw in zone on the goves, grats some necro in our guild (we got so many now) on the bracer and Babkins on the book,  Then Lord Bob for something that nobody wanted - Tett got something here but I dont recall people getting wet over it, off to kill Doomshade but we got bad intel on Doomshade being due but good practice pulling the DMs and finished off with Master Yael for Eats shoulders.  <br />
<br />
All in all it was small beans, but it was lots of fun and at least we werent all standing around with our thumbs in our asses.<br><br>
<br><br></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="000000" align="left"><font class="content">comments? <a class="pn-normal" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=recommend_us&amp;file=index&amp;req=FriendSend&amp;sid=47"><img src="images/global/friend.gif" border="0" alt="Send this story to a friend"></a> <a class="pn-normal" href="print.php?sid=47"><img src="images/global/print.gif" border="0" alt="Printer friendly page"></a></font></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><br><br><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" bgcolor="000000" width="100%"><tr><td><table border="0" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="1" width="100%"><tr><td bgcolor="000000" background="themes/0ri0n/images/cellpic1.gif"><b><a class="pn-title" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=news&amp;file=article&amp;sid=46&amp;mode=thread&amp;order=0&amp;thold=0">Two more, almost Three firsts for us.   Yeah, I know - not Hoss but fuck it - it was fun.</a></b><br></font></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="000000"><font class="tiny">Posted by <b>Tiberinus Maximus</b> on Monday, January 06, 2003 - 07:36 PM PST (25 Reads)<br><br>We FINALLY found Rhag 1 up, after months.   Killed him - excellent kill.   Moved to Rhag 2, lost at 1% - bascially, we didnt know what the fuck to expect on either fight, was fun as hell.   <br />
<br />
Then Klandicar was up and we killed him.<br />
<br />
Finished off the night fixing faction with a Vindicator kill.<br />
<br />
Grats to everyone on the stuff.<br><br>
<br><br></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="000000" align="left"><font class="content">comments? <a class="pn-normal" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=recommend_us&amp;file=index&amp;req=FriendSend&amp;sid=46"><img src="images/global/friend.gif" border="0" alt="Send this story to a friend"></a> <a class="pn-normal" href="print.php?sid=46"><img src="images/global/print.gif" border="0" alt="Printer friendly page"></a></font></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><br><br><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" bgcolor="000000" width="100%"><tr><td><table border="0" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="1" width="100%"><tr><td bgcolor="000000" background="themes/0ri0n/images/cellpic1.gif"><b><a class="pn-title" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=news&amp;file=article&amp;sid=45&amp;mode=thread&amp;order=0&amp;thold=0">The Long Vacation is OVER</a></b><br></font></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="000000"><font class="tiny">Posted by <b>Tiberinus Maximus</b> on Thursday, January 02, 2003 - 06:42 AM PST (17 Reads)<br><br>Thats right, the holidays are over, the hangover is gone.<br />
<br />
Lets see what the hell did we do while everyone was boozing it up and getting fat on turkey?<br />
<br />
EXP - Leveled, AAs, Quests, Killed shit.<br />
<br />
Recently:  Zlandicar, Gozzrem come to mind.<br />
<br />
We also got some epic fights done, oh yeah Beastlord Epic.   <br />
<br />
More Flags - Sony, Sir, Trials suck ass.   Not because they are impossible or really hard to do, because you go in and win and go LD and cant loot a mark (that sucks).   You go in some goes LD and you have to leave.   The boss runs up and kills the guy immediately.   The group before you wins and you have to wait 30 minutes.   The group before you loses and leaves shit up and you go in and multiple waves over and over no boss mob, no dead prisioner.   Yeah, TRIALS SUCK.<br />
<br />
Oh well, life goes on.   Anyway, things have been slow and many people have become quite bored with the exp grinding and watch, in a week people will complain about raiding too much.<br><br>
<br><br></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="000000" align="left"><font class="content">comments? <a class="pn-normal" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=recommend_us&amp;file=index&amp;req=FriendSend&amp;sid=45"><img src="images/global/friend.gif" border="0" alt="Send this story to a friend"></a> <a class="pn-normal" href="print.php?sid=45"><img src="images/global/print.gif" border="0" alt="Printer friendly page"></a></font></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><br><br></td><td>&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td valign="top" bgcolor="#000000"><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="150" bgcolor="8c1818"><tr><td><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="1" cellpadding="3"><tr><td bgcolor="000000" background="themes/0ri0n/images/cellpic1.gif"><font class="topictitle">Server Status</font></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="222222"><font class="content"><font class="content">
